ront hit.<\/p>\r\n    <ul class=\"checklist\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\r\n      <li>0% financing for up to 60 months<\/li>\r\n      <li>Trade-in credit toward your new system<\/li>\r\n      <li>Factory-trained, licensed & insured technicians<\/li>\r\n      <li>Full manufacturer warranty on new equipment<\/li>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550 BENEFITS \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550 -->\r\n<section class=\"section-benefits\">\r\n  <div class=\"benefits-header reveal\">\r\n    <p class=\"pre-label\">The Smart Time to Upgrade<\/p>\r\n    <h2>Why Trade In Your <span>Old System<\/span><\/h2>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n  <div class=\"benefits-grid\">\r\n    <div class=\"benefit-card reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:.1s\">\r\n      <span class=\"card-num\">01<\/span>\r\n      <div class=\"card-icon\">\r\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M11.8 10.9c-2.27-.59-3-1.2-3-2.15 0-1.09 1.01-1.85 2.7-1.85 1.78 0 2.44.85 2.5 2.1h2.21c-.07-1.72-1.12-3.3-3.21-3.81V3h-3v2.16c-1.94.42-3.5 1.68-3.5 3.61 0 2.31 1.91 3.46 4.7 4.13 2.5.6 3 1.48 3 2.41 0 .69-.49 1.79-2.7 1.79-2.06 0-2.87-.92-2.98-2.1h-2.2c.12 2.19 1.76 3.42 3.68 3.83V21h3v-2.15c1.95-.37 3.5-1.5 3.5-3.55 0-2.84-2.43-3.81-4.7-4.4z\"\/><\/svg>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <h3>0% Financing<\/h3>\r\n      <p>Spread your new system over up to 60 months interest-free, so a major upgrade fits comfortably into your budget.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"benefit-card reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:.2s\">\r\n      <span class=\"card-num\">02<\/span>\r\n      <div class=\"card-icon\">\r\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M21 18v1c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H5c-1.11 0-2-.9-2-2V5c0-1.1.89-2 2-2h14c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v1h-9c-1.11 0-2 .9-2 2v8c0 1.1.89 2 2 2h9zm-9-2h10V8H12v8zm4-2.5c-.83 0-1.5-.67-1.5-1.5s.67-1.5 1.5-1.5 1.5.67 1.5 1.5-.67 1.5-1.5 1.5z\"\/><\/svg>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <h3>Trade-In Credit<\/h3>\r\n      <p>Get real value for your old unit and apply it directly toward your new high-efficiency system.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"benefit-card reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:.3s\">\r\n      <span class=\"card-num\">03<\/span>\r\n      <div class=\"card-icon\">\r\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1 15h-2v-2h2v2zm0-4h-2V7h2v6z\"\/><\/svg>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <h3>Lower Energy Bills<\/h3>\r\n      <p>Modern systems run dramatically more efficiently than older equipment \u2014 that means real savings on every power bill.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"benefit-card reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:.4s\">\r\n      <span class=\"card-num\">04<\/span>\r\n      <div class=\"card-icon\">\r\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"\/><\/svg>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <h3>Fewer Repairs<\/h3>\r\n      <p>Reliable new equipment means fewer breakdowns and far fewer surprise repair bills down the road.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"benefit-card reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:.5s\">\r\n      <span class=\"card-num\">05<\/span>\r\n      <div class=\"card-icon\">\r\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 3v2m0 14v2M5.6 5.6l1.4 1.4m10 10l1.4 1.4M3 12h2m14 0h2M5.6 18.4L7 17m10-10l1.4-1.4M12 8a4 4 0 100 8 4 4 0 000-8z\"\/><\/svg>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <h3>Better Comfort<\/h3>\r\n      <p>Enjoy more even cooling, quieter operation, and improved humidity control throughout your whole home.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"benefit-card reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:.6s\">\r\n      <span class=\"card-num\">06<\/span>\r\n      <div class=\"card-icon\">\r\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V5l-9-4zm0 10.99h7c-.53 4.12-3.28 7.79-7 8.94V12H5V6.3l7-3.11v8.8z\"\/><\/svg>\r\n      <\/di